WEBVTT

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:12.050
The moonless dawn cloaks the light that pierces the depths of the forest,

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:17.870
asking its inhabitants for a destination.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:29.050
Yet the knowledgeable old woman remains silent,

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:41.390
even as the birds harmonize with the reddening dawn.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:46.990
Chapter Six

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:46.990
Miitsu

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.380
Izana, can you hear me?

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:48.300
When we have resolved matters here, we will return with Kuro.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.970
Please remain safe until we do.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:56.050
Izana, can you hear me?

00:01:58.560 --> 00:01:59.890
Everything is under control.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.850
There's no need for you to come here.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.870
We can deal with it ourselves.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.960
Stay there.

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:27.380
I will report again when we have taken care of this little issue.

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:31.760
Izana, their target is undoubtedly the Miitsu.

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.970
I realize that.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:37.180
If the situation gets out of control, we have no choice but to use it.

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:38.350
What are you saying?!

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.430
You must not! That is–

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.150
Everything's been dealt with...?

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.110
We must make haste.

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.570
I have a foreboding feeling.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.670
The enemy is in this direction! Move out!

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.290
Area C:

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.880
the enemy is taking a route above you.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.710
Intercept them at Block 44.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.550
Don't mess up!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.300
R-Roger that.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.090
T-There's a monster in here...

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.660
This is Area C!

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.580
We're being slaughtered! Those of us who are left–

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.760
Over here.

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:41.860
Why couldn't you guys do this too?

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:44.780
Saniwa, where are you right now?

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.030
In an underground passage.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:47.950
What's the situation?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:51.870
The enemy has penetrated Block F and the death toll is rising.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.250
Abandon the north and south sections.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:59.130
Order everyone to retreat to the Central Block and seal the door.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:03.380
If we do that, we'll surrender more than half of the base's resources.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.630
Is that all right?

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:06.420
Do it.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.430
We cannot allow further casualties.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.360
This passage is being sealed.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:23.940
If you are in the vicinity, please seek refuge immediately.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:28.610
I repeat: this passage is being sealed.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.700
If you are in the vicinity, please seek refuge immediately.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.750
This should buy us some time–

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.970
Who ordered you to seal the doors?

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:52.050
Was it Saniwa?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.970
That meddlesome woman.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.490
Izana. Why are you...?

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.410
Do they surrender? Or is it a trap?

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:20.420
Giving the order to retreat... has she gone mad?

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:24.040
Does she think that by escaping today, we'll be able to win tomorrow?

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.460
But there will be more casualties if–

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.510
You babble a lot, don't you?

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.930
Izana, wait!

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.350
What are you planning to do?!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:38.730
Izana!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.150
Izana's acting strange.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:35.030
He's lured the enemy into the Central Block.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:38.120
He's alone in the Control Room.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.670
He's probably using the Miitsu...

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:49.050
We are currently in the vicinity of the central area.

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.960
Please inform me of the fastest route there.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.300
What <i>is</i> the Miitsu?

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.640
Why is the enemy targeting it like this?

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.850
The Miitsu is a blood sample.

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:02.060
Blood?

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:03.810
Whose?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:09.520
Don't tell me. Kuromitsu's, right?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.250
Izana has also...

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.960
been seduced by her blood.

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:37.970
Have you forgotten our reasons for seeking her out?!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:42.770
We paid a heavy price to prevent that blood from being misused by the Red Army!

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:44.890
Dispose of that blood immediately!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.230
This blood contains unfathomable power.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:52.360
If we make use of its power, we'll hold a trump card against the Red Army.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.030
What foolishness!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:57.490
You intend to use the same excuses as the Red Army!

00:11:57.490 --> 00:12:01.120
What will we do if you succumb to its allure?

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.710
Two in front.

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.550
Behind them, another two.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:16.600
This presence...

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:22.510
Now it's become interesting.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.560
They've come this far already?

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.200
Welcome...

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:06.330
to Haniwa Castle.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:09.700
You've used the Miitsu?

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.470
Such poor judgment.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:33.440
Its abilities are not accessible to everyone.

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.950
You thought you could escape?

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.000
Voyeurism is a bad habit.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.670
Kuro!

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.800
I see...

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:51.390
You defeated Anubis?

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.940
It's better this way.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.490
We no longer have to fear that the Miitsu will be misused.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:37.990
Looks like the Haniwa have disbanded.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:40.490
In more ways than one.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:45.210
What should we do now...

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.210
Saniwa?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.630
Let us depart for Suruhai.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.550
We must meet Kuromitsu.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:02.060
We will find all the answers we desire there.

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:07.400
Kuromitsu...

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:28.060
Next Chapter

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:28.060
Kagura
